   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Nominal style",
     "texto": [
      "In formal texts the noun is preferred to the verb: **Nach dem Verkauf des Hauses** (after the sale of the house) instead of «after the house was sold». The genitive shows whom or what something belongs to.",
      "With **trotz** and **wegen** (lesson 27) nominal style is very common: **Wegen der Nachfrage** (because of demand)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verb and noun at once",
     "texto": [
      "Some constructions combine verb and noun: **zur Entscheidung kommen** (to reach a decision), **in Betrieb nehmen** (to start up), **einen Beitrag leisten** (to make a contribution). They are fixed expressions."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Verb",
